  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "Coordinates": {
        "properties": {
          "latitude": {
            "type": "number",
            "maximum": 90.0,
            "minimum": -90.0,
            "title": "Latitude"
          },
          "longitude": {
            "type": "number",
            "maximum": 180.0,
            "minimum": -180.0,
            "title": "Longitude"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "latitude",
          "longitude"
        ],
        "title": "Coordinates"
      },
      "GenerationConditions": {
        "properties": {
          "latitude": {
            "type": "number",
            "title": "Latitude"
          },
          "longitude": {
            "type": "number",
            "title": "Longitude"
          },
          "distance_km": {
            "type": "number",
            "title": "Distance Km"
          },
          "distance_tolerance_km": {
            "type": "number",
            "title": "Distance Tolerance Km"
          },
          "scoring_weights": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScoringWeights"
          },
          "route_preference": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RoutePreferenceWeights"
          },
          "traffic_stress_recipe": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TrafficStressRecipeOverride"
          },
          "generated_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Generated At"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "latitude",
          "longitude",
          "distance_km",
          "distance_tolerance_km",
          "scoring_weights",
          "route_preference",
          "traffic_stress_recipe",
          "generated_at"
        ],
        "title": "GenerationConditions",
        "description": "この生成に実際に適用された条件のエコー（実験の記録・再現用、研究IF改善 §10-6）。\n\nscoring_weights / route_preference は「リクエストで上書きされた値」または\n「YAML既定値」のうち実際に使われた方。レスポンスJSONを保存すれば、同じ条件を\nscoring_weights / route_preference としてそのまま再送して再現できる。"
      },
      "HTTPValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Detail"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "title": "HTTPValidationError"
      },
      "RouteCandidate": {
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Id"
          },
          "direction_label": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Direction Label"
          },
          "distance_km": {
            "type": "number",
            "title": "Distance Km"
          },
          "geometry": {
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "type": "object",
            "title": "Geometry"
          },
          "elevation_gain_m": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Elevation Gain M"
          },
          "min_elevation_m": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Min Elevation M"
          },
          "max_elevation_m": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Max Elevation M"
          },
          "max_gradient_percent": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Max Gradient Percent"
          },
          "wind_score": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Wind Score"
          },
          "road_score": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Road Score"
          },
          "stop_density": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Stop Density"
          },
          "traffic_stress_score": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Traffic Stress Score"
          },
          "bicycle_infra_score": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Bicycle Infra Score"
          },
          "intersection_density": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Intersection Density"
          },
          "accident_density": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Accident Density"
          },
          "total_score": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Total Score"
          },
          "score_breakdown": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RouteScoreComponent"
                },
                "type": "array"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Score Breakdown"
          },
          "segments": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RouteSegmentDetail"
                },
                "type": "array"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Segments"
          },
          "overall_difficulty": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Overall Difficulty"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "direction_label",
          "distance_km",
          "geometry"
        ],
        "title": "RouteCandidate",
        "description": "`overall_difficulty`: segmentsの`difficulty`（絶対基準0-100）の距離加重平均\n（domain/difficulty.py: distance_weighted_difficulty）。total_scoreが同一generate\n呼び出し内の候補間でしか比較できない相対値なのに対し、これは絶対基準なので\n**異なる実験（重み・条件）間の比較**に使える（研究インターフェース改善 §10-7）。\nsegments欠損時・全区間difficulty欠損時はNone。\n\n`stop_density`: ルート全体の信号・横断歩道・一時停止・踏切の合計密度（回/km、\n静的道路属性P1）。domain/traffic.py: distance_weighted_stop_density（合計count÷\n合計distance_kmの単純比、road_score等の「率の加重平均」とは集約方法が異なる）。\n\n`traffic_stress_score`: ルート全体の交通ストレス（1-4）の距離加重平均\n（domain/difficulty.py: distance_weighted_difficulty、道路情報の集計と同じ加重平均方式）。\n`bicycle_infra_score`: ルート全体の専用自転車インフラ（分離・レーン）区間の距離加重率(%)\n（domain/traffic.py: distance_weighted_bicycle_infra_score、road_scoreと同じ集約方法）。\n`intersection_density`: ルート全体の交差点密度（回/km、stop_densityと同じ集約方法）。\nいずれも静的道路属性P1残り。\n\n`accident_density`: ルート全体の事故密度（件/(km・年)、外部静的データソース T50残作業）。\ndomain/accident.py: distance_weighted_accident_density（stop_densityと同じ「合計count÷\n合計distance_km」に収録年数での正規化を加えた集約）。"
      },
      "RouteGenerateRequest": {
        "properties": {
          "latitude": {
            "type": "number",
            "maximum": 90.0,
            "minimum": -90.0,
            "title": "Latitude"
          },
          "longitude": {
            "type": "number",
            "maximum": 180.0,
            "minimum": -180.0,
            "title": "Longitude"
          },
          "distance_km": {
            "type": "number",
            "maximum": 100.0,
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0.0,
            "title": "Distance Km"
          },
          "distance_tolerance_km": {
            "type": "number",
            "maximum": 50.0,
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0.0,
            "title": "Distance Tolerance Km",
            "default": 5.0
          },
          "route_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "const": "loop",
            "title": "Route Type",
            "default": "loop"
          },
          "scoring_weights": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScoringWeights"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "route_preference": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RoutePreferenceWeights"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "traffic_stress_recipe": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TrafficStressRecipeOverride"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
